    "visuals.color": {
      "status": "I",
      "page": "",
      "owner": "Gines Lopez",
      "notes": "Palette fixed by the owner on 2026-10-09, derived from the iMoles HF prototypes: brand hue 225° (brand.600 #00698C), neutrals in the brand hue, crimson #DB2149 (high risk), amber #8D6F00 (intermediate), light teal #168072 (low), plum #6C2768 (not assessable); coral, green and violet removed. All four levels use a solid fill with white text and a tint with dark text from their family. Contrast validated against WCAG 2.2 (all listed pairs pass). Color-vision differences recorded as ΔE OKLab in normal vision, deuteranopia, protanopia, tritanopia and achromatopsia; by decision of the owner, pairs below 8 are covered by badge shape and text (WCAG 1.4.1). Interaction values approved by the owner on 2026-10-10 (hover step 650, pressed 700, surfaces neutral.25/100, focus ring brand.600, disabled neutral.150/600, scrim neutral.950 at 48%). Token format for the future DS implementation, outside this repo: W3C DTCG. Token names in English, confirmed by the owner on 2026-10-10. Corrections the iMoles prototype needs to adopt this palette are listed on the page and kept as tasks here; they are iMoles work, not work of this section. Stays in I: no recorded review.",
      "tasks": [
        {
          "text": "Validate on device the difference between default and pressed interaction states",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "Test the palette on device",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "Check color distinction with users or an on-device color-vision simulation tool",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "iMoles prototype · Replace the palette in imoles-tokens.css: Apply the primitives on this page: brand 225°, neutrals 225°, light teal for low risk, amber.600, plum; remove coral, green and violet.",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "iMoles prototype · Regular actions with a risk color: action.primary = brand.600 for all; action.alert only for booking an appointment for high risk.",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "iMoles prototype · Intermediate-risk badge: A single amber.600 fill (4.77:1) for badge and action.",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "iMoles prototype · Notices with risk colors: status.warning, status.error and status.info (neutral).",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "iMoles prototype · Insufficient field outline: border.control = neutral.400.",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "iMoles prototype · Chip Estado · high risk outside the tokens: risk.high.tint + risk.high.text.",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "iMoles prototype · Neutral chip: text.body in the chip.",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "iMoles prototype · High-risk secondary label: Remove it; use risk.high.text.",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "iMoles prototype · Duplicated and hard-coded values: Merge into text.secondary and border.subtle; use text.inverse and bg.surface; shadow as an elevation token (1.5).",
          "when": "pending"
        },
        {
          "text": "Define the dark theme and high-contrast mode (out of scope for now)",
          "when": "future"
        }
      ],
      "review": {
        "by": "",
        "date": "",
        "evidence": ""
      },
      "exclusionReason": ""
    },
